    "body": "## Problem\n\n`vim.lsp.enable()` errors with `Invalid buffer id` when a buffer is wiped after its config's `root_dir` calls back but before the client starts.\n\nFixes #42487\n\n## Solution\n\nDon't start the client if the buffer is no longer valid.\n",
